    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McCormack Properties are delighted to present this exceptional 3-bedroom semi- detached residence to the market. Constructed in 2022 and boasting an impressive A-rated BER, this spacious and contemporary family home offers stylish, energy-efficient living in the heart of Allenwood Village.\n\nSet back from the road and approached by a generous cobblelock driveway, the property immediately impresses with its attractive façade and high-quality finish throughout. Designed with modern family life in mind, the home is bright, spacious, and beautifully presented. Key features include an air-to-water heat pump, premium 12mm timber flooring, a fully fitted contemporary kitchen, mechanical ventilation systems in the kitchen, utility room, and bathrooms, and an EV charging point. Every detail has been carefully considered to provide comfort, efficiency, and convenience.\n\nExternally, the property continues to impress. The front offers ample off-street parking, while the private rear garden has been professionally landscaped to create a low-maintenance outdoor space ideal for relaxation and entertaining. This superb home is sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers and must be viewed to be fully appreciated.\n\nAllenwood is a bustling village with all the amenities necessary for family life including a local national school, a newly built playground and is close to the Grand Canal, ideal for leisurely walks, fishing and cycling. An idyllic setting for rural life yet the busy towns of Naas, Newbridge, Maynooth and Kildare Village are a mere 15-20min drive away. There is easy access to the M4 and M7 urban routes making this an ideal prospect for commuters.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment. To arrange a viewing, please contact DNG McCormack Properties on 045 832535."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 5.40m x 1.10m\nCeramic tiled flooring, bright open area, large understairs storage area\n\nSitting Room - 3.74m x 3.86m\nTimber flooring, front aspect, spacious room, tv point\n\nGuest WC - 1.54m x 1.78m\nCeramic tiled flooring, subway wall tiles, WC, WHB\n\nKitchen - 3.56m x 5.90m\nCeramic tiled flooring, tiled splashback area, double doors to rear, recess lighting, fully fitted kitchen units at floor & eye level\n\nUtility Room - 10.55m x 1.97m\nCeramic tiled flooring, storage cabinet, plumbed for washing machine and dryer\n\nLanding - 4.09m x 0.99m\nTimber flooring, access to attic, hotpress with storage space\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.65m x 3.79m\nTimber flooring, floor to ceiling built in wardrobes , rear aspect, usb charging points\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 1.48m x 1.99m\nCeramic tiled floor and shower area, WC, WHB, step in corner power shower unit\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.86m x 2.78m\nTimber flooring, floor to ceiling built in wardrobes , front aspect\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.68m x 3.03m\nTimber flooring, floor to ceiling built in wardrobes , front aspect\n\nOffice/Storage - 1.51m x 1.68m\nTimber flooring, suitable as a home office or additional storage space\n\nBathroom - 2.07m x 1.99m\nCeramic tiled flooring 7 shower/batha rea, WC, WHB, bath with overhead shower, wall mounted heated towel rail\n\n"
      },
